                            <p>
                                Jonathan Wisniewski partners with executive teams to strengthen the leadership behaviors
                                that drive sustainable results.
                            </p>
                            <p>
                                With more than three decades of leadership experience across organizations including
                                Dale Carnegie Training, Big Brand Tire &amp; Service, and Haas Automation, Jonathan
                                understands firsthand the realities leaders face — operational pressure, cross-functional
                                alignment challenges, and the demand for consistent performance.
                            </p>
                            <p>
                                Jonathan facilitates structured, high-engagement working sessions that translate strategy
                                into disciplined leadership execution. Drawing from extensive experience in operations,
                                sales, human resources, and enterprise-level development initiatives, he equips leaders to
                                build clarity, accountability, and measurable performance improvement.
                            </p>
                            <p>
                                Clients value Jonathan for his ability to quickly build trust, challenge thinking constructively,
                                and create alignment around actionable commitments. His facilitation style blends real-world
                                credibility with practical application — ensuring insights move beyond the training
                                room and into daily leadership practice.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <blockquote class="about-quote">
