                <div class="about-main">
                    <section class="about-main__bio" aria-labelledby="about-alison-bio-heading">
                        <h2 id="about-alison-bio-heading" class="about-main__section-title">About</h2>
                        <blockquote class="about-quote">
                            <p>
                                Creating transformational change in organizations and helping people aspire to and attain
                                their most desired goals is my professional passion.
                            </p>
                        </blockquote>
                        <div class="about-prose">
                            <p>
                                For three decades, Alison has focused her career on making businesses more effective as
                                well as enhancing the lives of the people she works with. At the core of her approach is
                                her Preparation | Collaboration | Inspiration philosophy — the heart of how she creates
                                outstanding, customized programs for clients, including facilitating learning workshops,
                                small group and one-on-one coaching, and a multitude of organizational and people
                                development programs.
                            </p>
                            <p>
                                Supporting clients’ most valuable resource — their people — is what truly drives her.
                                Her mission is to support an organization’s ability to make great leaders by providing
                                specialized leadership solutions tailored to meet both their business and professional
                                goals. She has worked with employees at every organizational level, from sales staff to
                                engineers to managers, and many C-suite executives from all over the world.
                            </p>
                            <p>
                                She also has broad experience across a diverse roster of corporate clients. In addition to
                                various custom programs, she brings an arsenal of resources to help client partners
                                achieve success through the learning and development programs listed here, alongside her
                                education in psychology and teaching.
                            </p>
                            <p>
                                Alison earned her BA in Psychology and certification in the Secondary Education Program at
                                the University of Iowa, and she has used her passion for education to help businesses and
                                people reach heights they never believed they could.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </section>

